Architecture parity:
  • SI on disk: distances stored as meters; converted only at the render boundary via
    SafetyConvert.distanceFromSI (web convertDistanceFromSI). Never miles in storage/compute.
  • Safety-enum choke point: every raw ADAS value funnels through AdasEnum.clean / AdasEnum.isActive
    (web lib/safetyEnum.ts) — bool→On/Off, number→decimal, string→prefix-stripped, SpeedAssistLevelNone→Off.
  • Tokens (P2): Color.TS.status*/chartCategorical/text*/border, Font.TS.*, TSSpacing/TSRadius — no
    hardcoded colors/typography; .regularMaterial stands in for web glass (ADR-005).
  • i18n (ADR-014): every visible literal via String(localized:) through one choke point
    (safetyText / safetyKey → "translation.<key>"); web key names kept; missing-key fallback guarded.
  • a11y (ADR-015): accessibilityLabel/Value on gauge + chart + panels, combined rows, Dynamic Type
    (Font.TS system fonts), tokens resolve light/dark + increased-contrast; ContentUnavailableView for
    empties; ≥44pt menu targets.
  • Adaptive (ADR-002/006): ViewThatFits score section, LazyVGrid(.adaptive) signal/stat/feature grids,
    horizontal-scroll history table, ToolbarItemGroup(.primaryAction) vehicle picker — one View for macOS + iOS.

